      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me write a formal letter to my landlord here in Berlin? My radiator in the living room stopped working yesterday and the apartment is getting really cold. I need to tell the Hausverwaltung that it needs to be fixed ASAP and that I'm expecting a response by the end of the week. Keep it professional and formal so they take it seriously.",
