      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the draft. but wait, did you say the radiator \"exploded\"? i didn't say it exploded, it just isn't getting warm. that sounds way too dramatic and might make them think i'm being unreasonable or lying about the damage. can you rewrite it to be more accurate? just say the heating element isn't working and the room temperature is dropping. please keep it very professional and standard for a German Hausverwaltung.",
